{"id":"15e91bb15396bbe1","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-polynomial-turing.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction","display":"df-polynomial-turing-reduction — Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-polynomial-turing","aliases":["73-df-binary-polynomial-turing","73-df-polynomial-turing-reduction"],"display":"df-polynomial-turing-reduction — Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction","depends_on":["[[73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-polynomial-turing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-polynomial-turing</span><span>73-df-polynomial-turing-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-turing-reduction — Polynomial-Time Turing Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1b6653dcbc23ade\" href=\"?note=e1b6653dcbc23ade\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime\">73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (binary languages)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^B(O)\">\\(L^B(O)\\)</span> (polynomial-time oracle machine and accepted language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e1b6653dcbc23ade\" href=\"?note=e1b6653dcbc23ade\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime\">73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_T^p B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\land L^B(O)=A\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_T^p B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\land L^B(O)=A\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The oracle machine halts on every input by the definition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B\\)</span>; this is a decision reduction, not merely oracle recognition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"e1b6653dcbc23ade","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"e1b6653dcbc23ade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B$ and $L^B(O)$ (polynomial-time oracle machine and accepted language, see [[73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B","display":false},{"tex":"L^B(O)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_T^p B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\land L^B(O)=A\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B","display":false}],"bytes":975,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e1b6653dcbc23ade"]}